"},"elements":[{"id":"af5f92c","elType":"widget","settings":{"image":{"id":4129,"url":"https:\/\/dev.biopentra.eu\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/info_box-300x200.webp"},"object-fit":"cover"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"image"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":true},{"id":"8768ce5","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<div class=\"biopentra-info-mega-templates\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"bp-detail-template-root\"><h3 class=\"biopentra-info-mega-detail-heading\">Quality Standards<\/h3><div class=\"biopentra-info-mega-detail-copy\"><p>Biopentra emphasizes quality-focused sourcing from established manufacturing partners.<\/p><p>Supporting documentation is manufacturer-provided and reviewed for consistency with published product information.<\/p><p>Where clarification is needed, we work with partners to obtain updated information.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"bp-detail-template-root\"><h3 class=\"biopentra-info-mega-detail-heading\">Third-Party Testing<\/h3><div class=\"biopentra-info-mega-detail-copy\"><p>Manufacturer-provided certificates may reference independent laboratory testing where available for a given product or batch.<\/p><p>Biopentra does not operate an in-house analytical laboratory; we rely on documentation supplied by manufacturing partners.<\/p><p>Specifics vary by SKU\u2014refer to materials provided with your purchase when applicable.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"bp-detail-template-root\"><h3 class=\"biopentra-info-mega-detail-heading\">Certificates \/ COAs<\/h3><div class=\"biopentra-info-mega-detail-copy\"><p>Certificates of Analysis (COAs) and related documents are manufacturer-provided when available and are intended to support transparency for research-use materials.<\/p><p>Format and batch specificity depend on the supplier and product line.<\/p><p>Unless explicitly stated on a listing, we do not represent that every unit maps to a unique, batch-specific certificate.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"bp-detail-template-root\"><h3 class=\"biopentra-info-mega-detail-heading\">Purity &amp; Analytics<\/h3><div class=\"biopentra-info-mega-detail-copy\"><p>Purity and analytical values reflect manufacturer-reported data unless otherwise noted.<\/p><p>Listings may summarize typical specifications rather than a single batch-specific certificate.<\/p><p>For the most current detail, consult manufacturer-provided documentation supplied with your order where applicable.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"bp-detail-template-root\"><h3 class=\"biopentra-info-mega-detail-heading\">Compliance &amp; Safety<\/h3><div class=\"biopentra-info-mega-detail-copy\"><p>Products are positioned for research use only (RUO) and should be handled consistent with applicable regulations and institutional requirements.<\/p><p>Our policy pages summarize key disclosures to support informed purchasing.<\/p><p>Customers remain responsible for lawful use, storage, and disposal in their jurisdiction.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"},{"id":"8666d82","elType":"widget","settings":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"}],"isInner":true,"isLocked":true}],"isInner":true,"isLocked":true},{"id":"d61b135","elType":"container","settings":{"_title":"Item #3"},"elements":[],"isInner":true,"isLocked":true},{"id":"8cf6810","elType":"container","settings":{"_title":"Item #3"},"elements":[],"isInner":true,"isLocked":true}]},{"id":"ab36992","elType":"widget","settings":{"login_text":"Log in","logout_text":"Log out","greeting":"Hello, %s","_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"10","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"dropdown_items":[{"nav_label":"My account","link_type":"my_account","_id":"83943a0"},{"nav_label":"Log out","link_type":"logout","item_style":"danger","_id":"a318a48"}]},"elements":[],"widgetType":"biopentra_header_auth"},{"id":"33c82dd","elType":"widget","widgetType":"shortcode","settings":{"shortcode":"[universal_multicurrency_switcher]","_css_classes":"bp-chrome-umc"},"elements":[]},{"i